  user_2,Thank you [pause] Ah yes I have your policy details right here What seems to be the issue with your policy today
  user_1,I was trying to file a claim but the system says my policy is expired
  user_2,I apologize for the inconvenience Let me check on the status [hold music starts] [hold music ends after 2 minutes]
  user_2,Vihaan I've checked on the status and it seems like your policy did expire last week
  user_1,What That can't be right I could've sworn I paid the premium
  user_2,I understand your concern Let me check on the payment history [typing] Ah yes it seems like the payment was due on the 1st of this month but we didn't receive it
  user_1,[sighs] I must have missed the email I've been really busy with work
  user_2,It's okay these things happen Let me see what we can do [pause] I can offer you a reinstatement option but you'll need to pay the premium and a small fee
  user_1,How much will that be
  user_2,[typing] Let me just calculate that for you [pause] It'll be a total of $250
  user_1,That sounds okay I'll pay it But can you also tell me why I didn't receive any reminders
